{"author_date": "2026-07-11T23:49:12Z", "author_login": "tapios", "commit_date": "2026-07-12T00:11:12Z", "committer_login": "tapios", "message": "Overhaul documentation and fix bugs found during audit\n\nDocumentation:\n- New README (badges, quick start, features, design principles) and logo\n- Restructure docs into getting-started, how-to, and design-philosophy pages\n- Revise docstrings throughout to follow CliMA documentation policy\n- Correct stale docs (MPI auto-detection was removed; FileLogger export)\n\nBug fixes (with regression tests):\n- Add missing abort method for SingletonCommsContext\n- Base.summary(io, device) now prints to io per the Base contract\n- FileLogger no longer crashes when an MPI run reuses a log_dir\n- Invalid coarsen option throws ArgumentError instead of StackOverflowError\n- Singleton reduce/allreduce/gather return copies, matching MPI methods\n\nCompat/CI:\n- Raise minimum Julia to 1.10 (LTS) and test 1.10 + 1.11 in CI", "sha": "f35d3054315f6fe08ad942345ae9734ed5b1e419"}
